WEBVTT

NOTE The launch video of the KTS 5.0 web portal and registration (1.2.69): the English voice-over, line by line.

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.000
Ladies and gentlemen, the moment has come.

2
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:14.810
The KTS 5.0 web portal and registration, launched by the Honourable Minister of Education, Shri Pralhad Joshi.

3
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:24.770
Kashi Tamil Sangamam 5.0 brings Kashi and Tamil Nadu together, around the Thirukkural, in Varanasi.

4
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:33.230
One thousand student delegates: one from each institution, chosen on merit, each with a stipend of ₹10,000.

5
00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:41.090
From today's launch to Varanasi, every step of a delegate's journey happens on the portal.

6
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:50.540
Every page speaks 23 languages: the 22 of the Eighth Schedule, and English.

7
00:00:53.910 --> 00:01:00.400
All 1,330 couplets, with CICT's own translations in every scheduled language.

8
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:09.200
The 108 Thirukkural form the syllabus, with questions ready in all 23 languages.

9
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:18.810
Every institution holds its own online assessment: 50 questions in 30 minutes, in the student's own language.

10
00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:27.660
A digital repository for every learner, including 44 videos in Indian Sign Language.

11
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:37.140
The couplets reach everyone: on screens at airports and stations, on posters, and in every classroom.

12
00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:46.570
For every delegate, one place: from registration and the stipend, to a certificate verified by QR code.

13
00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:55.030
Thirukkural Payilvom. Thirukkural Abhyas Karen. Visit kts.cict.in.
